<html lang="en">

  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Book Return Reminder</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; } .container { padding: 20px;
      background-color: #f4f4f4; } .content { background-color: white; padding:
      20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
      .footer { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: gray; }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Hello, {{name}}!</h1>
        <p>We hope you're enjoying your book,
          <strong>{{bookTitle}}</strong>.!📖✨</p>
        <p>This is a gentle reminder that your return date is approaching.
          Please ensure the book is returned by
          <strong>
            {{expectedReturnDate}}
          </strong>
          to avoid any late fees or restrictions.</p>
        <br />
        <p>
          Book Details:
          <br />📚 Title:
          <strong>{{bookTitle}}</strong>
          <br />
          📅 Due Date:
          <strong>{{expectedReturnDate}}</strong>
          <br />
          <br />
          If you’ve already returned the book, kindly ignore this message.
          Otherwise, please return it on time or contact us if you need an
          extension.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>Thank you for being a valued reader!<br /><strong>LMS Team</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>

</html>